<title>GERMANY: Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</title>
<headline>Bundesbank data show fall in net reserves in week.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bundesbank data released on Wednesday show that net currency reserves fell to about 106.5 billion marks in the week ending December 7 from about 107.3 billion in the week ending November 30.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank provided the following reserve data: (in</p>
<p>billion marks)</p>
<p> Banking week ended		    Dec 7	   Nov 30</p>
<p> Gross currency reserves	     122.6	   123.3</p>
<p> Foreign liabilities		   16.1	    16.0</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
